i.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T01:49:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T01:49:55Z","body":"When I reported the issue in #122481, I did not use this fix, because this does not fully fix the problem.\r\n\r\nThere are additional places that require the lock, like unregister_extension_class(), as this one erases default_values and default_values_cached. A worker can run class_get_default_property_value() while an extension unloads or reloads.\r\n\r\nA lesser problem, because the window is smaller is the usage in set_property_default_value() because this would happen only during class initialization, and arguably this is rarer - so this patch narrows the window, but does not fully fix the problem.  \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5707203333/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5708633915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123546#issuecomment-5708633915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123546","id":5708633915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVELXOw","user":{"login":"exaltedo2","id":173569997,"node_id":"U_kgDOClh3zQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173569997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2","html_url":"https://github.com/exaltedo2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/gists{/gist_id}","s